# Build context is the repo root (see Dockerfile); BuildKit reads this file
# because it sits next to the Dockerfile. Allow-list: send only what the API
# build needs, never node_modules, tests or local build output.
*
!.editorconfig
!apps/api/.editorconfig
!apps/api/Directory.Build.props
!apps/api/stylecop.json
!apps/api/src/
apps/api/src/**/bin/
apps/api/src/**/obj/
